{#-
  BLOCK: gallery — §06's `gallery`. A listing, in Design's two shapes.

  SIX SIZES BECAME TWO (5th package). `row` is photo-left 120×90 with the price,
  the address and the specs beside it, separated from the row above by a
  hairline; it serves every list and, with `chip`, the badged Sold/Active
  variant. `card` is the 264px-wide photo-on-top card the gallery kinds lay out
  two across. "Six photo sizes was a builder concern; two shapes read better and
  halve the test surface."

  The price is `ink` (`primary_ink`) and carries `tr-brand`, so the dark-mode
  style block can give it a brand ink derived for the dark card. The status chip
  is a reserved §3.3 pair, never the brand: Sold `#065F46` on `#D1FAE5`,
  Active/Pending `#475569` on `#F1F5F9`.

  B5 IS WHY THE MISSING-PHOTO BRANCH IS A CELL AND NOT AN `<img>` WITH NO SRC: an
  absent photo once rendered as a broken-image glyph on one surface and a blank
  box on another. It is one grey cell here, in both shapes.

  Values arrive formatted from `_gallery_card_context()`, where the fallbacks
  are testable.
-#}
{% if size == 'card' -%}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">{{ photo_html }}<div class="tr-brand" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:{{ ink }};">{{ price }}</div><div class="tr-ink" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0F172A;">{{ address }}</div>{% if specs %}<div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:12.5px;color:#64748B;">{{ specs }}</div>{% endif %}</td></tr></table>
{%- else -%}
<tr><td class="tr-rule" style="padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #ECEAE3;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td width="120" valign="top" style="width:120px;">{{ photo_html }}</td><td valign="top" style="padding-left:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">{% if chip_text %}<span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:6px;padding:2px 7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;background:{{ chip_bg }};color:{{ chip_fg }};">{{ chip_text }}</span><br>{% endif %}<span class="tr-brand" style="font-size:17px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:{{ ink }};">{{ price }}</span><div class="tr-ink" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0F172A;">{{ address }}</div>{% if specs %}<div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:3px;font-size:12.5px;color:#64748B;">{{ specs }}</div>{% endif %}</td></tr></table></td></tr>
{%- endif %}
